es at the end they  give you real world cases to deal with  as exercises which i did a lot in  business school and it was great to see  that be part of these courses you get a  real life scenario a business wants to  solve a problem  and it pertains to a lesson that you  just took so lectera lets you take what  you learned and put it into practice  it's one thing to take a course and  watch videos it's even more valuable to  see it applied to real situations so  please check out lecterra i've put a  link underneath this video i've enjoyed  the courses i've gotten a lot out of  them a lot of business related topics  that you can study  marketing sales like i said uh social  media etc endless topics to discover and  again i want to thank lecterra for  sponsoring this video you can get free  access to the course that i took on  lectera by clicking the link right  underneath the video and using the code  pacman  you
 

